abstract: >-
  A Lean-checked formalization scaffold and research manuscript for two
  conditional routes to the Riemann Hypothesis. The release records the
  generic Grassmann/Fekete Toeplitz closure, exact-ready effective and Jensen
  receptors, numerical diagnostics, theorem-status ledger, and the remaining
  open analytic inputs. It does not claim a proof of the Riemann Hypothesis.
